      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرَسَهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرْسٌ</span>, <i>He wrote it;</i> namely,
a writing or book; as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَطَرَهُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also 2. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرِسَ</span>, a verb like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرِحَ</span>, <i>He</i> (a man)
<i>became worn out in body, and aged.</i> (Sgh, TA.)

